activity Identify Risk
activity Assess Impact
activity Evaluate Probability
activity Prioritize Risks
activity Develop Mitigation Plan
activity Implement Mitigation
activity Monitor Risks
activity Review Risk Assessment
activity Update Risk Register
activity Communicate Risks
activity Approve Mitigation Plan
activity Document Lessons Learned
activity Escalate Critical Risks
activity Conduct Risk Workshop
activity Validate Risk Controls
bind Identify Risk: Risk Category, Risk ID
bind Assess Impact: Impact Score, Risk ID
bind Evaluate Probability: Probability, Risk ID
bind Prioritize Risks: Risk ID, Exposure Value
bind Develop Mitigation Plan: Risk ID, Mitigation Strategy, Mitigation Cost
bind Implement Mitigation: Risk ID, Risk Status
bind Monitor Risks: Risk ID, Review Frequency
bind Review Risk Assessment: Risk ID
bind Update Risk Register: Risk ID, Risk Status
bind Communicate Risks: Risk ID, Risk Owner
Risk Category: Financial, Operational, Compliance, Strategic, Reputational
Impact Score: integer between 1 and 10
Probability: float between 0.0 and 1.0
Risk Status: Open, Mitigated, Closed, Accepted
Mitigation Cost: float between 0.0 and 100000.0
Review Frequency: integer between 1 and 12
Risk Owner: John Smith, Alice Johnson, Bob Williams
Risk ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Mitigation Strategy: Avoidance, Transference, Mitigation, Acceptance
Exposure Value: float between 0.0 and 1000000.0
Init[Identify Risk] | |
Absence3[Escalate Critical Risks] | |
Precedence[Assess Impact, Identify Risk] | | |
Response[Assess Impact, Evaluate Probability] | | |
Precedence[Prioritize Risks, Evaluate Probability] | | |
Response[Prioritize Risks, Develop Mitigation Plan] | | |
Precedence[Implement Mitigation, Develop Mitigation Plan] | | |
Response[Implement Mitigation, Monitor Risks] | | |
Succession[Monitor Risks, Review Risk Assessment] | | |
Response[Review Risk Assessment, Update Risk Register] | | |
Succession[Update Risk Register, Communicate Risks] | | |
